# Date picker
Date Picker selects one calendar date. The locale also determines the first weekday; `weekStartsOn` can override it. Arrow keys move by day or week, Home/End move within a week, and Page Up/Down move by month (Shift: year). Use `min`, `max`, or `isDateUnavailable` to restrict choices. Values use the stable `YYYY-MM-DD` format.
